# Campus Customs — environment variables (placeholders only; copy to .env
# if you ever need one, and never commit the real .env).
#
# This app needs NO secrets to run. Every AI model call goes through the
# Claude Code CLI (`claude -p`), authenticated with your own Claude Code
# subscription — not an API key. The backend deliberately strips
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY from the environment before calling `claude`
# (backend/llm/claude_client.py), so the line below is intentionally unused.
#
# Placeholder only — do not put a real key here:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-api-key-here
#
# What you do need: `claude` installed and logged in (run `claude` once in a
# terminal and follow the prompt). See README.md.
